Package: golemcrypto
Title: Interactive Cryptocurrency Time Series and Market Data Explorer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dimitrios", "Zacharatos", , "dzacharatos@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1789-8294"))
Maintainer: Dimitrios Zacharatos <dzacharatos@yahoo.com>
Description: A 'shiny' application for exploring cryptocurrency exchange rates.
    Plots interactive candlestick and volume charts of historical prices since
    2013 for any active cryptocurrency, and shows a table of the top 100
    cryptocurrencies by market capitalisation with price changes over 24 hours
    to 90 days, market dominance and fully diluted market cap, with
    Bollinger bands and the relative strength index on the price charts.
    Also compares normalized prices of several coins, on their own or
    relative to one of them, and shows a market cap treemap, a calendar of
    monthly returns, their seasonality by day of the week, week of the
    year, month, year of the halving cycle and calendar effects such as the
    turn of the month, whether a coin's recent volatility is normal, with a
    GARCH forecast, and its falls from its all-time high.
    Market data is retrieved from 'CoinMarketCap'.
